So we call the new method like this: 

`./build/bin/bitcoin-cli -regtest -rpcwallet=testwallet addinputpsbt "cHNidP8BAgQCAAAAAQMEAAAAAAEEAQIBBQECAfsEAgAAAAABDiCVivP1XV+2t3qPFhZ3zJDJz9H8sDNhlj+bjX5rhuwKRwEPBAMAAAABEAT9////AAEOIJWK8/VdX7a3eo8WFnfMkMnP0fywM2GWP5uNfmuG7ApHAQ8EAQAAAAEQBP3///8AAQMIwGh4BAAAAAABBBYAFJHVZfM/pFsw/tmN7WuWLuR8RcXQAAEDCAAOJwcAAAAAAQQWABRn8M5HK4YsdNxvOVcthN3XIhjzrAA=" '[{"txid":"470aec866b7e8d9b3f966133b0fcd1cfc990cc7716168f7ab7b65f5df5f38a95","vout":2}]'
`

